    "marketInfo": {
      "assetDescription": "<p>NGI+ is a tokenized interest in a private infrastructure equity fund linked to Partners Group Next Generation Infrastructure.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Manager:</strong> Partners Group, a Swiss-listed private-markets manager (~USD 185B AUM).</li>\n<li><strong>Value:</strong> Tracks the fund's monthly NAV per share, net of fees. Grows through NAV appreciation, not on-chain distributions.</li>\n<li><strong>Points:</strong> NGI+ positions on Pendle earn <a href=\"https://reale.finance/points\">Reale Points</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Underlying APY:</strong> Annualised change in NGI+ NAV (USDC per NGI+) over the trailing 90 days. The fund updates NAV about monthly, so the figure moves in steps. Historical, not a forecast. Can be negative if NAV falls.</li>\n<li><strong>YT yield:</strong> Paid only when NAV rises above its previous high (high-water mark). After a NAV drop, realised YT yield can be lower than the displayed APY until NAV recovers.</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "riskInvolved": "<ul>\n<li>Backed by a private markets fund. NAV updates monthly and can rise or fall.</li>\n<li>Fund redemptions have periodic limits and can be restricted or suspended.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>(From Underlying Protocol)</strong></p>",
      "importantQuirks": "<p>Two ways to trade NGI+:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Instant Router (recommended):</strong> Settles on-chain immediately. No KYC, no minimum. Routed to AMM pools or RFQ market makers, so size depends on on-chain liquidity.</li>\n<li><strong>Primary Market:</strong> KYC required. Min 100,000 USDC or equivalent. Monthly dealing cycle: - Subscribe by T-10, tokens delivered by T+23</li>\n<li>Redeem by T-45, proceeds paid by T+26</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Best for tickets larger than on-chain liquidity.</p>",
      "initiatedBy": "Asseto",
